{"id":"00269","root":"uni00269_1","name":{"ja":"黒田　巴","en":"Kuroda Tomoe"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"黒田　巴","en":"Kuroda Tomoe"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-11-30","limited":true,"characterId":199,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園に通う見習い対魔忍。対魔忍の中でも武家の名門として名高い家に生まれ、幼い頃から過酷な鍛錬を積んできた。そのおかげで、実戦経験は少ないながら、近接戦闘においては隊長クラスの対魔忍にも高い評価を得ている。また規律にも厳しくしつけられてきたため、やや堅すぎるほどにルールや規則を重んじる性格。思いこみが激しい一面もあり、ルールを破る者とは真正面からぶつかる一方、一度信頼した相手には全幅の信頼を寄せて疑うことをしないほどのめり込むことも。五車学園に入学してから戦闘教官の蓮魔零子と出会い、その厳しくも公平な指導と苛烈な戦いぶりに心を奪われた。今まで漠然と持っていた理想像を蓮魔に見出した彼女は、蓮魔に心酔し、少しでも近づきたいと一心に努力を重ねる。その姿は「まるで信者のようだ」と言われる程ののめり込みぶりであった。","en":"Kuroda Tomoe is an apprentice Taimanin attending Gosha Academy. Born into a prestigious samurai family renowned among Taimanin, she has endured harsh training since childhood. Thanks to that, despite having little real-combat experience, she earns high praise from even captain-ranked Taimanin for her close-quarters fighting. Raised with strict discipline, she places an almost excessive emphasis on rules and regulations. While she will confront anyone who breaks the rules head-on, she also throws herself completely into those she trusts, never doubting them. After entering Gosha Academy, she met combat instructor Hasuma Reiko, whose strict yet fair guidance and fierce battles captured her heart. Seeing in Reiko the ideal she had only vaguely imagined, Tomoe became devoted to her, striving relentlessly to get even a little closer. Her devotion is said to be \"like that of a true believer.\""},"illustrator":"TANA","voiceActor":"青葉りんご","forms":[{"id":"uni00269_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[934,1868],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[149,298],"def":[123,246],"spd":[46,46],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["1","410001"]},{"id":"uni00269_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1368,2736],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[233,466],"def":[181,362],"spd":[46,46],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40